WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:04.220
Hi, I'm Tilly! Every yank is kept now, as a paste buffer.

00:00:05.320 --> 00:00:07.160
Let's yank three lines in copy mode.

00:00:08.521 --> 00:00:10.401
Each one is kept as its own buffer.

00:00:14.261 --> 00:00:17.681
Control B, then the closing bracket, pastes the newest one.

00:00:18.052 --> 00:00:21.092
Control B, then hash, shows them all, newest first.

00:00:21.442 --> 00:00:23.442
Pick an older one, and Enter pastes it.

00:00:26.322 --> 00:00:28.962
Want to try it? The install guide is right here.
